ustom_build [15073afe3]**.\nBoth compiled using SCons `precision=double`. \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable (4c311cbee) - Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) HD Graphics 620 (KBL GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7500U CPU @ 2.70GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs the documentation implies, using large world coordinates should allow Godot to handle numbers larger than the 32 bit integer limit without overflows. This does not seem to apply to the `range()` method.\nWhen the range method has a number larger than `2147483646` as the second parameter, it returns an empty array. If the number is placed in the first parameter, Godot throws a \"Cannot resize array.\" error.\n\nThis leads me to believe that any number above `2147483646` internally overflows into the negatives.\n\n<img width=\"677\" height=\"49\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6934a0c8-d7ea-4c79-95af-70246c03967f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create new project\n- Attach the following code to a node in the SceneTree:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint(range(2147483640, 2147483646+1))\n\tprint(range(2147483640, 2147483647+1))\n```\n- Observe debug output\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee above","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109373/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}